藉ソ鍛垫姢浠栨垚闀裤��", "鍙�浜哄�朵笉闇�瑕佸晩锛佷笉銆侀渶銆佽�併�佸晩鈥︹��", "鐏甸笭鎮勭劧鐨勫瀭鐪革紝濂逛笉浼氭壙璁ゅス鏈夐偅涔堜竴鐬�鐨勯毦杩囬吀娑┿��", "杩欏張鏄�琚�瀚屽純鎶涘純浜嗗憲锛岀畻浜嗭紝涔熶笉鏄�绗�涓�娆′簡锛岀畻涓�浠�涔堜簨銆�", "澶╀笅涔嬪ぇ锛岃繕鎬曟病濂圭伒楦犵殑瀹夊眳涔嬫墍鍚椼�傝繖閲屽張涓嶆槸鐜颁唬锛屾病鏈夐粦蹇冪殑鎴垮湴浜у晢锛屽ス闅忎究瀵讳釜鍦帮紝涔板嚑杞︽湪澶存惌涓�涓�鎴垮瓙灏卞ス鐨勭獫浜嗭紝娌℃湁鐗╀笟璐圭�＄悊璐规按鐢佃垂锛屽�氳交鏉捐嚜鍦ㄣ��", "鐏甸笭瓒婃兂瓒婅�夊緱濂斤紝宸茬粡寮�濮嬫瀯鎬濆湴鏂硅�呬慨鐨勯棶棰樸��"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "卿本黑萌之妖妃来袭", "content_zh": "第003章 渴望的温柔“吁……”食盒到手，灵鸠喟叹一声，慢悠悠的打开，慢悠悠的捏着块桂花糕，慢悠悠的送到自个嘴里吃着，整个人软得似没有骨头。仰望着漫天星空和萤火，跟个八十老儿似的悠叹了一声：“人生真是寂寞如雪啊。”如果早知道这里到了夜里，会呈现出这样惊心动魄的美景，她早该睡过头。“噗。”不合时宜的声音响起，身前那位白袍纤细，宛若一阵风就能吹跑的面具少年，一手捂着肚子，“哈，哈哈哈哈！”不知道是不是从未这么笑过，他双肩笑得颤抖得厉害，弯腰蹲在了地上，似乎一个不好就能笑得满地打滚儿。“……”灵鸠面无表情。这货有病！“小妹妹。”面具少年温柔的嗓音，沾着明朗的笑意，让夜晚也温暖了，“你叫什么名字？”无视，继续无视。如果是往日，灵鸠一定会选择眼不见为净的离开。可是今天的夜景太美，美好得超出了她的见识，比电影呈现出来的电脑科技要真实自然太多。尤其是少年的声音，那种清幽的似眼前月光下反射粼粼波光的河水，缓缓的毫无攻击性的流淌着，从耳朵流淌进人的心里，让人不自觉的平静祥和下来。她……渴望一切温暖和温柔的东西，无法抗拒，又害怕深入的靠近。只要这样，贪婪的自私的享受一会少年的温柔，再一会就好了。得不到回应的少年没有了声音。灵鸠压抑着想坐起身去看，他是不是走了的欲望。忽然觉得身旁有异响，余光见到少年坐在她身旁的草地上，仰头望着什么。由下朝上的看，灵鸠看见少年还不明显的喉结，颈项雪白得像是会融化的肌肤，一切都给人一种脆弱的，空灵的，随时都会忽然消失一般的不真实的幻美感。“抓到你了。”忽然，少年带着一丝促狭的声音响起，“你在偷看我。”“……”一朝失足酿造千古恨！少年依旧坐着没动，没有任何进攻性的压迫，温柔清幽的嗓音缓缓的响起，“为什么要无视我？”灵鸠绷着脸，目光装作看风景，她却不知道她的眼瞳已经印出少年的身影，清晰的倒影。“……”一声叹息，少年脱下外衣，盖在女孩的身上。他的手迟疑的，又渴望般的触碰女孩的头发，轻柔的触碰几乎让人感受不到。灵鸠不知道为什么，就是觉得这一刻，面具后的那张脸一定是笑着，温柔得能让人哭出来的微笑。“早点回去，这里每晚都这么漂亮，以后还能来看。”灵鸠捏紧双手，身体和面皮都紧绷着，眼底深处暴露出她的不知所措。她渴望又害怕一切温暖和温柔，过于干净虔诚的温柔会让她变得蠢笨，像是得了社交障碍，不知道该怎么去反应和回应。少年的身影渐渐远去，隐匿在林间。“灵鸠，我叫灵鸠。”完全看不到少年的身影，她才低低的说出声。说完之后，黯然的垂下目光，看到身上的雪白的外衣，以及……一柄没有消失的琴。看着身上的这件衣物，灵鸠想着是烧了还是丢了。这上面沾着一层晦气，在人身边放久了，会给人带来厄运。一番深思熟虑之后，灵鸠抽出一张黄符，‘嘭’着了红火，朝白衣丢去。墨绿色的晦气只有灵鸠看得见，在红火的灼烧下一点点的消散，最后白衣竟然毫无损伤，透出一股人气。“怎么会！”灵鸠惊诧的拿着白衣左看右看，确定感受到人气没有错。这是件人间的衣物，并不是晦气凝聚虚物。妖鬼不会自找罪受的去穿人的衣物，人间凡物沾有的阳气会对他们产生伤害。“他是人？”灵鸠囧了一张脸。如果对方是个人，那么她自欺欺人的无视，在对方眼里算什么！丢脸丢到姥姥家了有木有！宅女本性都暴露了有木有！这也不能怪她啊，那少年浑身都弥漫着股妖鬼晦气，衣着打扮异于常人，对于她这种能将鬼怪看得清楚如常人一样的人，会看错也不奇怪好吗。在现代的时候，做起了资深宅女，这样的乌龙就很少发生了。灵鸠揪紧了白衣，呆坐了好一会，恍然回神，“啊，再不回去，就得被记过了。”起身走在半路，又顿住步伐。“……”抿着嘴唇盯着河边的琴，泄了一口气走过去，又一团符火丢上去，烧尽了上面的晦气后，用白衣将琴包着，放在原先躺着的巨木树洞里。这样也不怕清晨潮深露重，或者下雨将这琴弄坏了。“……会不会找不到？”临走前，灵鸠又生了顾虑，抽出一根木钉，往树干上刻上‘↓╮（▔▽▔）╭↓’这个标志后，才满意的收回木钉。忽然朝河边看去，眼神毫无波动，“要是再敢将晦气沾上来……免费送你们火葬哦亲。”［嘤嘤嘤嘤］一群萤火中连话都不会说的低等鬼灵们一哄而散。哼唧，她就迁怒了怎么样。如果不是那人浑身和琴都沾满了鬼灵的晦气，周围又环绕的那么多的‘灵’，她怎么会认错。灵鸠面无表情的提着食盒，往回走。因为一次的失踪晚归，灵鸠被辛嬷嬷禁足了五天，再度去林间河边相隔上次足有七天。夏日炎炎，中午刚过，天气一点都没有凉快。不过，当看到树下躺着人时，她便觉得周围的空气变得清凉平和了。灵鸠顿足一瞬，然后放轻了脚步，微微弓着身子，像只偷腥的猫儿般悄悄的往少年靠近。只见她表情紧绷，双眼圆瞪极度的认真谨慎，更让人觉得她在做什么坏事儿，随时都会被吓得炸毛逃开。在面具少年身边不足半米距离外停下，灵鸠看着少年的眼眸闪过异光。好浓……好浓的晦气！浓郁得完全盖过了他的人气，难怪上次她会认错！这样的人能活到这个年纪不是奇迹，就是用无数珍贵药材吊着身子。一般人在他身边呆久了的话，一定会被他的晦气牵连，霉运重重，甚至被鬼灵沾身，惹来血光之灾，杀身之祸。“哈——！”走神之间，突如其来的高叫入耳。“嗷！”灵鸠思维还没跟上来，已经反条件狼嚎一声，蹦跶一步远，紧绷得弓着身子，瞪大眼睛。“哈……哈哈哈哈。”那罪魁祸首笑声清朗，坐在草地上，又笑得双肩颤抖。“……”认为他温柔的自己，其实是眼睛瞎了吧。“嗯？生气了？”少年笑声停了，清幽柔和却毫无怯弱感的嗓音透出一抹歉意，“因为你真的太有趣了，才没有忍住吓唬你。”骚年，有趣不是一个好的形容词，谢谢。真相是灵鸠再次被过于温柔的嗓音蛊惑，紧绷着脸呆木的摇头。“这个就作为我给你赔罪礼如何？”少年拿出食盒，将里面一碟碟精致的糕点拿出来。这糕点只看卖相，就比她平日吃的高级不是一点两点。灵鸠抽了抽鼻子，香……这段日子她发现穿越一大好处，美食多！比起现代她常年储藏的存粮——泡面，面包，火腿肠，鱼罐头，牛肉罐头等等……这里的东西，真的太好吃了有木有！最终没有忍住美食的诱惑……她绝对不会承认，去吃那被污染了晦气的糕点，更大原因是不忍拒绝这个温柔纯澈的少年。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/qingbenheimengzhiyaofeilaixi/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 003 The tenderness of longing \"Huh...\" After receiving the food box, Lingjiu sighed, slowly opened it, slowly pinched a piece of sweet-scented osmanthus cake, and slowly put it into his mouth to eat. His whole body was so soft that he seemed to have no bones. Looking up at the starry sky and fireflies, she sighed like an 80-year-old: \"Life is so lonely as snow.\" If she had known that this place would show such a breathtaking scenery at night, she should have overslept long ago. \"Pfft.\" An inappropriate voice sounded. The young man in front of him in a slender white robe, who looked like a mask that could be blown away by a gust of wind, covered his stomach with one hand, \"Ha, hahahaha!\" I don't know if he has never laughed like this before. His shoulders shook so much from laughing that he bent down and squatted on the ground, as if he could roll on the floor with laughter if he didn't make a mistake. \"...\" Lingjiu's face was expressionless. This guy is sick! \"Little sister.\" The gentle voice of the masked boy, with his bright smile, made the night warm. \"What's your name?\" Ignore it and continue to ignore it. If it were the past, Lingjiu would definitely choose to leave without seeing. But today's night scene was so beautiful, beyond her imagination. It was much more real and natural than the computer technology shown in the movie. Especially the young man's voice, that kind of quiet and quiet like the river water reflecting the sparkling waves under the moonlight in front of you, flowing slowly and non-aggressively, flowing from the ears into people's hearts, making people unconsciously calm and peaceful. She... longed for all things warm and tender, unable to resist, yet afraid of getting too close. As long as this is the case, the greedy and selfish can enjoy the tenderness of the young man for a while, and then it will be fine. The boy who didn't get a response was silent. Lingjiu suppressed the desire to sit up and see if he was gone. Suddenly she felt a strange noise beside her, and out of the corner of her eye she saw a young man sitting on the grass next to her, looking up at something. Looking from bottom to top, Lingjiu saw the young man's Adam's apple, which was not yet obvious, and his neck, which was as white as melting skin. Everything gave people a fragile, ethereal, and unreal illusion of beauty that could suddenly disappear at any time. \"I caught you.\" Suddenly, the young man's voice sounded with a hint of narrowness, \"You were peeking at me.\" \"...\" One misstep will create eternal hatred! The young man still sat motionless, without any offensive pressure. A gentle and quiet voice slowly sounded, \"Why are you ignoring me?\" Lingjiu's face was sullen, her eyes pretending to look at the scenery, but she didn't know that her pupils had already printed the young man's figure, a clear reflection. \"...\" With a sigh, the boy took off his coat and covered the girl's body. His hand touched the girl's hair hesitantly and eagerly, the gentle touch almost imperceptible. Lingjiu didn't know why, but he felt that at this moment, the face behind the mask must be smiling, a smile so gentle that it could make people cry. \"Go back early. This place is so beautiful every night. We can come and see it in the future.\" Lingjiu clenched her hands, her body and face were tense, and her confusion was revealed deep in her eyes. She desires and is afraid of all warmth and tenderness. Too pure and pious tenderness will make her stupid, as if she has a social disorder and does not know how to react and respond. The young man's figure gradually moved away and was hidden in the forest. \"Lingjiu, my name is Lingjiu.\" She said in a low voice without seeing the boy's figure at all. After finishing speaking, he lowered his gaze sadly and saw the snow-white coat on his body, and... a piano that had not disappeared. Looking at the clothes on his body, Lingjiu wondered whether they had been burned or lost. There is a layer of bad luck on it, and if left around people for a long time, it will bring bad luck to them. After some careful consideration, Lingjiu took out a yellow talisman, lit it with red fire, and threw it towards Bai Yi. The dark green bad luck could only be seen by Lingjiu, and it dissipated bit by bit under the burning of the red fire. In the end, the white clothes were undamaged, exuding a sense of popularity. \"How could it be!\" Lingjiu looked around in his white clothes in shock, making sure that he felt the popularity was correct. This is a piece of clothing in the human world, not an imaginary thing where bad luck condenses. Demons and ghosts will not ask for trouble by wearing people's clothes. The yang energy contained in mortal objects will cause harm to them. \"Is he a human?\" Lingjiu looked embarrassed. If the other party is a person, then her self-deception and ignorance are nothing in the eyes of the other party! Isn’t it embarrassing to be thrown into grandma’s house? The otaku's true nature has been exposed! You can't blame her. The boy's whole body is full of evil spirits, and his clothes are different from ordinary people. For someone like her who can see ghosts as clearly as ordinary people, it's not surprising that he sees them wrong, right? In modern times, if you become a senior otaku, such mistakes rarely happen. Lingjiu tightened her grip on Bai Yi and sat there for a while, then suddenly came to her senses and said, \"Ah, if you don't go back, you will be remembered.\" He got up and walked halfway, then stopped again. \"...\" He pursed his lips and stared at Qin by the river. He breathed a sigh of relief and walked over. He threw another ball of talisman fire on it and burned away the bad luck on it. Then he wrapped Qin in white clothes and placed it in the hole of the huge tree where it was originally lying. In this way, there is no need to worry about the early morning tide being heavy or the rain damaging the piano. \"...can't I find it?\" Before leaving, Lingjiu became worried again. He took out a wooden nail and carved the sign '↓╮(▔▽▔)╭↓' on the tree trunk before taking back the wooden nail with satisfaction. Suddenly he looked towards the river, his eyes unwavering, \"If you dare to bring bad luck to me again... I'll send you a free cremation, dear.\" [嘤嘤嘤嘤] A group of low-level ghosts among the fireflies who couldn't even speak dispersed in a hurry. Humph, she just vented her anger. If it weren't for the fact that the man and his body were covered in the bad luck of ghosts and spirits, and there were so many 'spirits' surrounding him, how could she admit her mistake. Lingjiu carried the food box with an expressionless face and walked back. Because she disappeared and returned late once, Lingjiu was detained by Grandma Xin for five days. It had been seven days since she went to the forest river again. It’s hot in summer, just after noon", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}